nodes.change_log:
■ NEW UPDATE!    v1.3.9

► Shores around the water have been redesigned;
► Improved graphics, trees wind movement;
► Paths & Trails have been added! - villagers generate dirt trails;
► Church & Priest added, improving town happiness;
► Snap Rotation option added for turning and locomotion;
► Option to set the ground/map higher or lower - added;
► Language localization added – now supports 36 languages;
► Villager Quests are now available!
► Improved Building Menu mechanics;
► Fixed an issue that sometimes prevented villagers from working;
► Wood logs no longer fall onto stones, allowing villagers to gather them correctly;
► Various bug fixes and performance improvements.

Enjoy, and thank you for your support!

